5,000 bond</title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/123369902.cms" /&gt;</description><link>https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/scared-to-go-back-to-india-truck-driver-harjinder-singh-who-killed-3-in-florida-was-allowed-to-stay-in-us-in-2018-on-5000-bond/articleshow/123369902.cms</link><guid>https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/scared-to-go-back-to-india-truck-driver-harjinder-singh-who-killed-3-in-florida-was-allowed-to-stay-in-us-in-2018-on-5000-bond/articleshow/123369902.cms</guid><pubDate>2025-08-18T22:53:33+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-123369938,imgsize-26458.cms"/></item><item><title>Rare pink diamond heist: How Dubai Police retrieved $25 million stolen gem; arrests 3 in just 8 hours</title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/123367379.cms" /&gt;Dubai Police swiftly recovered a rare $25 million pink diamond after it was stolen from a European trader lured to a villa by a gang posing as wealthy buyers. Using advanced surveillance and AI, police arrested three suspects from an unspecified Asian country within eight hours.</description><link>https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/rest-of-world/rare-pink-diamond-heist-how-dubai-police-retrieved-25-million-stolen-gem-arrests-3-in-just-8-hours/articleshow/123367379.cms</link><guid>https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/rest-of-world/rare-pink-diamond-heist-how-dubai-police-retrieved-25-million-stolen-gem-arrests-3-in-just-8-hours/articleshow/123367379.cms</guid><pubDate>2025-08-18T20:05:35+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-123368693,imgsize-52130.cms"/></item><item><title>Times Square subway evacuated after suspicious package found, bomb squad investigates</title><description/><link>https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/times-square-subway-evacuated-after-suspicious-package-found-bomb-squad-investigates/articleshow/123368405.cms</link><guid>https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/times-square-subway-evacuated-after-suspicious-package-found-bomb-squad-investigates/articleshow/123368405.cms</guid><pubDate>2025-08-18T21:29:09+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-123368442,imgsize-39784.cms"/></item><item><title>'If you are trying to brain-drain Bangalore...': US economist's H-1B explanation goes viral</title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/123368281.cms" /&gt;</description><link>https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/if-you-are-trying-to-brain-drain-bangalore-us-economists-h-1b-explanation-goes-viral/articleshow/123368281.cms</link><guid>https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/if-you-are-trying-to-brain-drain-bangalore-us-economists-h-1b-explanation-goes-viral/articleshow/123368281.cms</guid><pubDate>2025-08-18T21:18:52+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-123368276,imgsize-34540.cms"/></item><item><title>'Admit until date': US embassy in India warns against overstaying, explains how it can happen</title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/123367476.cms" /&gt;</description><link>https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/admit-until-date-us-embassy-in-india-warns-against-overstaying-explains-how-it-can-happen/articleshow/123367476.cms</link><guid>https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/admit-until-date-us-embassy-in-india-warns-against-overstaying-explains-how-it-can-happen/articleshow/123367476.cms</guid><pubDate>2025-08-18T20:13:49+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-123367455,imgsize-39268.cms"/></item><item><title>'We don't expect but...': White House checks with Ukraine officials if Zelenskyy can wear a suit today</title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/123366927.cms" /&gt;Ahead of a crucial meeting, the White House inquired about Volodymyr Zelenskyy's attire, hoping for a suit to appease Donald Trump, who previously criticized his military-style clothing. Ukraine officials confirmed that Zelenskyy won't be wearing a suit but would don his black jacket that he wore at the Nato summit as that looks like a suit. </description><link>https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/we-dont-expect-but-white-house-checks-with-ukraine-officials-if-zelenskyy-can-wear-a-suit-today/articleshow/123366927.cms</link><guid>https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/we-dont-expect-but-white-house-checks-with-ukraine-officials-if-zelenskyy-can-wear-a-suit-today/articleshow/123366927.cms</guid><pubDate>2025-08-18T19:32:46+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-123366934,imgsize-28474.cms"/></item><item><title>'When confronted and destroyed!' Donald Trump links Hamas' fate to hostage return; cites ending '6 wars in 6 months'</title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/123366565.cms" /&gt;Donald Trump asserted that the release of hostages held by Hamas hinges on the group's confrontation and destruction. He emphasized his past achievements in securing hostage releases and resolving conflicts, highlighting his role in freeing hundreds of hostages and ending multiple wars. Trump urged decisive action, advocating for a strategy focused on victory.</description><link>https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/when-confronted-and-destroyed-donald-trump-links-hamas-fate-to-hostage-return-cites-ending-6-wars-in-6-months/articleshow/123366565.cms</link><guid>https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/when-confronted-and-destroyed-donald-trump-links-hamas-fate-to-hostage-return-cites-ending-6-wars-in-6-months/articleshow/123366565.cms</guid><pubDate>2025-08-18T19:12:13+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-123366727,imgsize-981296.cms"/></item><item><title>Row over Indian-origin truck driver Harjinder Singh: California Guv's office says he entered US under Trump presidency</title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/123366387.cms" /&gt;</description><link>https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/row-over-indian-origin-truck-driver-harjinder-singh-california-guvs-office-says-he-entered-us-under-trump-presidency/articleshow/123366387.cms</link><guid>https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/row-over-indian-origin-truck-driver-harjinder-singh-california-guvs-office-says-he-entered-us-under-trump-presidency/articleshow/123366387.cms</guid><pubDate>2025-08-18T18:55:57+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-123366412,imgsize-26458.cms"/></item><item><title>'Seriously controversial ': Donald Trump raises concerns over accuracy of voting machines; vows executive order to end mail-in ballot before 2026 midterms</title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/123365328.cms" /&gt;Donald Trump announced a movement to eliminate mail-in ballots and voting machines before the 2026 midterms, citing "massive voter fraud." He plans an executive order targeting voting machines and advocates for watermarked paper ballots, claiming they're faster and more reliable.</description><link>https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/seriously-controversial-donald-trump-raises-concerns-over-accuracy-of-voting-machines-vows-executive-order-to-end-mail-in-ballot-before-2026-midterms/articleshow/123365328.cms</link><guid>https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/seriously-controversial-donald-trump-raises-concerns-over-accuracy-of-voting-machines-vows-executive-order-to-end-mail-in-ballot-before-2026-midterms/articleshow/123365328.cms</guid><pubDate>2025-08-18T18:44:49+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-123365996,imgsize-32952.cms"/></item><item><title>UAE youth join summer camp on culture and technology as part of 2025 year of community</title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/123365985.cms" /&gt;The ECAE Summer Camp 2025 blended Emirati heritage with modern technology, engaging youth aged 12–17 in traditional crafts, digital fabrication, and cultural storytelling. Hosted in Abu Dhabi, the camp fostered intergenerational learning and creativity, aligning with the UAE’s Year of Community and ECAE’s mission of lifelong education.</description><link>https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/middle-east/uae-youth-join-summer-camp-on-culture-and-technology-as-part-of-2025-year-of-community/articleshow/123365985.cms</link><guid>https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/middle-east/uae-youth-join-summer-camp-on-culture-and-technology-as-part-of-2025-year-of-community/articleshow/123365985.cms</guid><pubDate>2025-08-18T18:38:31+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-123366095,imgsize-1101722.cms"/></item><item><title>'Russia deliberately killing people': Zelenskyy condemns ‘cynical’ strikes ahead of Trump talks</title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/123363808.cms" /&gt;</description><link>https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/europe/russia-deliberately-killing-people-zelenskyy-condemns-cynical-strikes-ahead-of-trump-talks-kharkiv-attack-kills-7-zaporizhzhia-wounds-20/articleshow/123363808.cms</link><guid>https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/europe/russia-deliberately-killing-people-zelenskyy-condemns-cynical-strikes-ahead-of-trump-talks-kharkiv-attack-kills-7-zaporizhzhia-wounds-20/articleshow/123363808.cms</guid><pubDate>2025-08-18T17:02:51+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-123363914,imgsize-974374.cms"/></item><item><title>'You don't live here': Google engineer shares H-1B woes, says she's anxious about making mistakes</title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/123365267.cms" /&gt;</description><link>https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/you-dont-live-here-google-engineer-shares-h-1b-woes-says-shes-anxious-about-making-mistakes/articleshow/123365267.cms</link><guid>https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/you-dont-live-here-google-engineer-shares-h-1b-woes-says-shes-anxious-about-making-mistakes/articleshow/123365267.cms</guid><pubDate>2025-08-18T17:53:30+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-123365243,imgsize-34540.cms"/></item><item><title>UAEFA warns clubs after Al Ain’s refereeing criticism following pro league opener</title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/123364984.cms" /&gt;The UAE Football Association has warned clubs against publicly criticizing referees, following Al Ain’s complaints after their 2-1 win over Al Bataeh. Legal action will be taken against those who undermine officials. Al Ain’s coach claimed five goals were disallowed, while the match featured the Pro League’s 9,000th goal and debuted a new stadium cooling system.</description><link>https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/middle-east/uaefa-warns-clubs-after-al-ains-refereeing-criticism-following-pro-league-opener/articleshow/123364984.cms</link><guid>https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/middle-east/uaefa-warns-clubs-after-al-ains-refereeing-criticism-following-pro-league-opener/articleshow/123364984.cms</guid><pubDate>2025-08-18T17:51:55+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-123365236,imgsize-206953.cms"/></item><item><title>New road toll rules: Abu Dhabi extends Darb toll hours by two hours starting September 1</title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/123360424.cms" /&gt;Starting September 1, 2025, Abu Dhabi's Darb toll gates will operate with extended hours, charging motorists Dh4 from 7am-9am and 3pm-7pm, Monday to Saturday. The daily and monthly toll caps are being removed, leading to unlimited charges. Exemptions remain for specific groups, as these changes aim to reduce congestion and promote public transport use.</description><link>https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/middle-east/new-road-toll-rules-abu-dhabi-extends-darb-toll-hours-by-two-hours-starting-september-1/articleshow/123360424.cms</link><guid>https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/middle-east/new-road-toll-rules-abu-dhabi-extends-darb-toll-hours-by-two-hours-starting-september-1/articleshow/123360424.cms</guid><pubDate>2025-08-18T16:38:03+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-123362469,imgsize-174964.cms"/></item><item><title>India’s banking giant launches investment funds in UAE: Check the details here!</title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/123360813.cms" /&gt;Kotak Mahindra Bank has secured a license from the UAE Securities &amp; Commodities Authority, marking it as the first Indian institution authorized for investment fund and portfolio management in the UAE. This move will enable Kotak to launch UAE-domiciled funds, primarily offering India-focused investment options to local and regional investors.</description><link>https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/middle-east/indias-banking-giant-launches-investment-funds-in-uae-check-the-details-here/articleshow/123360813.cms</link><guid>https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/middle-east/indias-banking-giant-launches-investment-funds-in-uae-check-the-details-here/articleshow/123360813.cms</guid><pubDate>2025-08-18T16:40:35+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-123361906,imgsize-38274.cms"/></item></channel></rss>